{"id":"activo","lemma":"activo","pos":"adj","rank":3004,"glosses":["active","up (a website, server, system, etc.; usually used when a website or server was previously \"down\" but is now back online)","top"],"ipa":"/aɡˈtibo/","forms":{"feminine":"activa","masculinePlural":"activos","femininePlural":"activas"},"audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/8/8e/LL-Q1321_%28spa%29-AdrianAbdulBaha-activo.wav","formAudio":{"activa":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/a/a8/LL-Q1321_%28spa%29-Marreromarco-activa.wav"},"examples":[{"text":"Ese estudiante es muy activo.","en":"That student is very active.","words":[{"g":"that"},{"g":"student"},{"g":"to be","l":"ser"},null,null]},{"text":"Quiero que los miembros jóvenes sean más activos.","en":"I want the young members to be more active.","words":[{"g":"to desire","l":"querer"},{"g":"that"},{"g":"the / them"},{"g":"limb","l":"miembro"},{"g":"young, youthful","l":"joven"},{"g":"to be","l":"ser"},{"g":"more"},null]},{"text":"Los búhos están activos por la noche.","en":"Owls are active at night.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/803870","words":[{"g":"the / them"},{"g":"owl, eagle owl","l":"búho"},{"g":"to be","l":"estar"},null,null,null,null],"phrases":[[4,7,"at night"]]},{"text":"Tom ha estado muy activo últimamente.","en":"Tom has been very active recently.","words":[null,{"g":"to have","l":"haber"},{"g":"country, land"},null,null,{"g":"recently, lately"}]},{"text":"Él jugó un papel activo en la revolución.","en":"He played an active part in the revolution.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/764967","words":[{"g":"he"},{"g":"to play","l":"jugar"},{"g":"a"},{"g":"paper"},null,{"g":"in / on"},{"g":"the / her"},{"g":"revolution"}]}]}